The code I've pasted out is for the PexAssumeUnderTest scenario from the [ArrayList Contract Test]. I could not get the scenario to work in Visual Studio Test, which didn't have a PexAssumeUnderTest scenario and the code was not available for that scenario in my case. Hence, I was not able to test it.
